# This folder holds session recordings.
# See v1/app/backend/api/session.py for the recorder.
# POST /session/start to begin, POST /session/end to finalise.
#
# Each run creates <timestamp>_<id>/ with:
#   events.jsonl  — full event firehose, one JSON per line
#   summary.md    — human-readable wrap-up
#
# The folder itself is gitignored. To commit a specific run as a
# regression reference:
#   git add -f v1/app/backend/sessions/<session-id>/
